    [Doc][Misc] Document Qwen3.5 batch invariance support (#18449)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Add `Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B` to the tested models for batch invariance and
    clarify that its support is limited to Atlas A2 and A3 Products.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. This is a documentation-only update with no runtime behavior
    changes.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Documentation-only change.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/8cc9aa5ad350f6f80cf3bebb298d410803ff75a9
    
